          "alias": "常规 1280",
          "prompt": "mizumi_zumi,void 0,betabeet,rolua,chocolate_(jitong),gaku,rella\n,no text, masterpiece,best quality,absurdres, very aesthetic,highres,no text,\n\n,year 2025,loli,\n\nTwo young girls are crouching tightly together behind a section of shattered concrete wall and twisted steel rebar. They are hiding in a destroyed city street filled with piles of debris and dust. It is deep night with heavy rain falling. One girl has tears mixing with the rain on her cheeks and presses both hands firmly over her mouth to stop herself from screaming. The other girl grips the first girl's arm tightly, her eyes wide with panic, looking sideways. Just beyond their cover, a massive, dark combat robot walks past on the wet pavement. The robot features glowing red optical sensors and a bright white searchlight that cuts through the rain and fog. The light from the robot partially illuminates the girls' dirty, ragged clothing and the fear on their faces,hiding behind wall, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text",
